           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/wpf/" title="View all posts in WPF" rel="category tag">WPF</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2010/07/advanced-wpf-listbox-scenario-representing-and-selecting-an-xml-hierarchy/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Advanced WPF ListBox Scenario: Representing and Selecting an XML Hierarchy"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="790 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/index.php/2010/07/advanced-wpf-listbox-scenario-representing-and-selecting-an-xml-hierarchy/">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
