            <span class="day">16</span>
           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/silverlight/" title="View all posts in Silverlight" rel="category tag">Silverlight</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/speaking/" title="View all posts in Speaking" rel="category tag">Speaking</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/wpf/" title="View all posts in WPF" rel="category tag">WPF</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2010/04/sketchflow-from-concept-to-production/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on SketchFlow: From Concept to Production"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="775 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/index.php/2010/04/sketchflow-from-concept-to-production/">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
