            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/silverlight/" title="View all posts in Silverlight" rel="category tag">Silverlight</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/speaking/" title="View all posts in Speaking" rel="category tag">Speaking</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/wpf/" title="View all posts in WPF" rel="category tag">WPF</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2010/04/kentucky-briefings-april-15th-and-22nd/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Kentucky Briefings April 15th and 22nd"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="774 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/index.php/2010/04/kentucky-briefings-april-15th-and-22nd/">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
          </div>

          <div class="post-content clearfix">
          <p>Along with a great cast of MS partners, evangelists, specialists and more I will be bringing Sketchflow to the Frankfort, KY area Thursday, April 15th.&#160; This will be Session I with Session II scheduled for April 22nd.&#160; You can learn about everything from Forefront Suite to Silverlight to Windows Phone 7 and, of-course, Sketchflow.&#160; You [...]</p>

