        <div id="post-732" class="post-732 post type-post hentry category-wpf">

          <div class="post-header">
           <h3 class="post-title"><a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2009/03/scaling-itemscontrol-items-for-explicit-visible-items-in-wpf/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: Scaling ItemsControl Items for Explicit Visible Items in WPF">Scaling ItemsControl Items for Explicit Visible Items in WPF</a></h3>
