            <span class="month">Mar</span>
            <span class="day">12</span>
           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/wpf/" title="View all posts in WPF" rel="category tag">WPF</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2009/03/scaling-itemscontrol-items-for-explicit-visible-items-in-wpf/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Scaling ItemsControl Items for Explicit Visible Items in WPF"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="732 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2009/03/12/scaling-itemscontrol-items-for-explicit-visible-items-in-wpf.aspx">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
