          <p>Another part of the overall solution we were trying to come up with in conjunction my previous post on Scrolling Multiple Content Areas, we also needed to come up with a way to only show X number of items in the visible region of an ItemsControl wrapped in a ScrollViewer.&#160; This was more tricky than [...]</p>

