          <div class="post-header">
           <h3 class="post-title"><a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2009/03/scrolling-multiple-content-areas-with-a-single-scrollbar-in-wpf/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: Scrolling Multiple Content Areas with a single ScrollBar in WPF">Scrolling Multiple Content Areas with a single ScrollBar in WPF</a></h3>
