           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/wpf/" title="View all posts in WPF" rel="category tag">WPF</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2009/03/scrolling-multiple-content-areas-with-a-single-scrollbar-in-wpf/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Scrolling Multiple Content Areas with a single ScrollBar in WPF"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="731 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2009/03/12/scrolling-multiple-content-areas-with-a-single-scrollbar-in-wpf.aspx">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
