            <span class="month">Nov</span>
            <span class="day">3</span>
           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/wpf/" title="View all posts in WPF" rel="category tag">WPF</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2008/11/the-wpf-mindset/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on The WPF Mindset"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="729 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2008/11/03/the-wpf-mindset.aspx">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
